{"data":{"body":"[P2] Restrict empty group-ID validation to FIFO queues\n\nFor standard queues, `messageGroupId` is documented as ignored, and `export()` sends `MessageGroupId: undefined`. This unconditional check makes previously working standard-queue configurations with `messageGroupId: \"\"` throw during construction, potentially breaking Lambda initialization even though no invalid ID would be sent. Apply this validation only to FIFO queues and add a standard-queue regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs8AAAABA17lbw","finding_digest":"9518e6a6d2fb6f23eb340512733c5ced0ca47c522572487cc5a0ea9bf63675ed","finding_id":"arf_v1_sumonjws7nxsh2zuaujhgpc45u","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-telemetry-exporter/src/exporters/sqs-exporter.ts::sqsexporter.constructor::standard-queue-group-id-ignored","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-telemetry-exporter/src/exporters/sqs-exporter.ts::sqsexporter.constructor::standard-queue-group-id-ignored","line":67,"observation_digest":"59d63412021ea42264e6cb06dc886e987eca5396c00d633b3fdd5ae90d02b37c","observation_id":"aro_v1_lhldieqcd2scezhgzmdnzcdotb","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-telemetry-exporter/src/exporters/sqs-exporter.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-22T17:35:13Z","review_id":"arr_v1_foezgpdywc5cv2nlhejjuufblp","reviewed_base_sha":"28002d32e65a6577c63cdf3c1b69480347cbe2ea","reviewed_head_sha":"cb5daa367ea587713a7fabea169ea8de3375c3e9","reviewer":"codex","start_line":67,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_sffzh4sxybagchvywqlwdgmx7e"},"pull_request":{"number":1059},"record_id":"art_v1_dsrkpiuzur2ervgvzwft5kbhbj","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-22T17:35:13Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
